                    {
                        "form_id": "1bf8462d-5406-452b-8250-2d23348df4fa",
                        "entry_id": "85f7a748-a16d-3319-995a-7e82b6e3ecfc",
                        "tags": [
                            "accusative",
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "die Volkszählungen"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "418d0135-7d2f-3998-bb2b-740d73d2246f",
                        "entry_id": "85f7a748-a16d-3319-995a-7e82b6e3ecfc",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Erhebung zur Zahl und gegebenenfalls zu ausgewählten Eigenschaften der Bevölkerung"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1be93939-8f96-4c7a-bbbf-f9e2c6c40326",
                                "sense_id": "418d0135-7d2f-3998-bb2b-740d73d2246f",
                                "text": "„Laut Volkszählung von 1939 leben in der Gemeinde insgesamt 530 Einwohner.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0bc5d7b4-e4f8-4cfb-8c79-8b883633bf7f",
                                "sense_id": "418d0135-7d2f-3998-bb2b-740d73d2246f",
                                "text": "„Als 1924 eine Volkszählung eine einigermaßen verlässliche Zahl von zehn Millionen Kongolesen ermittelt, stellt sich durch Erhebungen von Regierungsstellen und Wissenschaftlern (basierend auf Berichten von Missionaren und Einwohnern) heraus, dass die Bevölkerung zwischen 1880 und 1920 um mindestens die Hälfte geschrumpft ist.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a3cea000-e06e-43f0-8671-25c2cf05bb33",
                                "sense_id": "418d0135-7d2f-3998-bb2b-740d73d2246f",
                                "text": "„Man hatte eine Volkszählung durchgeführt.\""
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "58485761-fa14-4591-a611-4a19dce34114",
                        "source_entry_id": "85f7a748-a16d-3319-995a-7e82b6e3ecfc",
                        "source_sense_id": "418d0135-7d2f-3998-bb2b-740d73d2246f",
                        "source_sense_description": "Erhebung zur Zahl und gegebenenfalls zu ausgewählten Eigenschaften der Bevölkerung",
                        "target_lang_word": "census",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "census",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7047a5e9-8957-3807-857a-8d706a45e37a",
                                        "entry_id": "f6b3cf82-675c-3dae-8589-363033aa1a17",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An official count or enumeration of members of a population (not necessarily human), usually residents or citizens in a particular region, often done at regular intervals."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d4cf0321-5a1a-4750-9a6a-aa2e6f581343",
                                                "sense_id": "7047a5e9-8957-3807-857a-8d706a45e37a",
                                                "text": "As you know, the Imperium has never been able to take a census of the Fremen. Everyone thinks that there are but few wandering here and there in the desert. My Lord, I suspect an incredible secret has been kept on this planet: that the Fremen exist in vast numbers- vast- and it is they who control Arrakis."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b25ee53c-b28e-3cac-8aa5-1e0b3f6375be",
                                        "entry_id": "f6b3cf82-675c-3dae-8589-363033aa1a17",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Count, tally."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "302f25bc-1d95-4c45-af8e-70a2ad2d826e",
                                                "sense_id": "b25ee53c-b28e-3cac-8aa5-1e0b3f6375be",
                                                "text": "In what census of living creatures, the dead of mankind are included ..."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "799e9407-49df-312c-826c-cd7d1a821d89",
                                        "entry_id": "f6b3cf82-675c-3dae-8589-363033aa1a17",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A type of tax levied by feudal lords on peasants."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "historical",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "09d5d0a1-f4e2-3f4f-872a-9e9dc6eed219",
                                        "entry_id": "f6b3cf82-675c-3dae-8589-363033aa1a17",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A count of the number of individual patterns within a larger pattern, most often the ash of a soup or a methuselah."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "census",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "83435295-1cd6-3daf-9f11-11296cea7157",
                                        "entry_id": "e81a69e4-0960-387e-8d6b-c7c666753b15",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To conduct a census on."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bed10f67-5f04-43fd-a630-d1fae32fa813",
                                                "sense_id": "83435295-1cd6-3daf-9f11-11296cea7157",
                                                "text": "Each page of the schedule was crossruled with 8 lines, capable of censussing 8 individuals."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "06b497f4-e3c1-4c39-9a9b-291d8c5336f8",
                                                "sense_id": "83435295-1cd6-3daf-9f11-11296cea7157",
                                                "text": "Indeed, none of the recorded characteristics of buildings nor their location affected our counts of breeding Sparrows, which appeared to be distributed rather homogeneously across the urban areas we censused."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c2279e87-b2f8-3c8f-a33c-d96e91a6e17a",
                                        "entry_id": "e81a69e4-0960-387e-8d6b-c7c666753b15",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To collect a census."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e9b63da2-330b-47ac-8bb7-ee7e0818101a",
                                                "sense_id": "c2279e87-b2f8-3c8f-a33c-d96e91a6e17a",
                                                "text": "My initiation to waterfowl censussing took place in the early days of the A.W.E., as it is familiarly known, when I served as a junior to one of the ablest of the Witwatersrand pioneers, Royce Reed. The method used must remain one of the three basic methods of Transvaal waterfowl censussing, although it has certain inherent limitations."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6e32474a-d5b8-4c25-a21c-135096ebabf5",
                                                "sense_id": "c2279e87-b2f8-3c8f-a33c-d96e91a6e17a",
                                                "text": "For 14 individuals, eight censusses per daily period were performed within two weeks (32 censusses per individual), each time recording the coordinates of location. The territories of the individuals were defined as the area defended successfully against conspecifics by agonistic and/or non-agonistic behaviour, as described by Wickler (1969) and Nelissen (1976). The locations of the territories were determined from censussing; their sizes were estimated by behavioural observations."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
